	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Legi literas tuas, compater et frater, nec sine <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>dolore maximo, non quod illa ignorarim hactenus <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et his primum veluti adobruar, sed quod repetita <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nunc iterum miserum illum statum non nostrum dumtaxat, <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>sed totius Helvetiae revocent sub oculos et con<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>templandum obiiciant.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quid vero nos, qui ministri <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Christi et ecclesiarum sumus, agere in tantis possumus <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>periculis?</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Commendare salutem publicam <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>deo potentissimo et clementissimo eidemque semper <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>offerre deprecationes et supplicationes, maxime <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>vero in munere nostro constanter progredi <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>Ieremiae instar, qui et ipse non sortitus est <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>meliora tempora.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Pergamus ergo accusare sce<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>lera et sceleratos, hortari omnes ad poenitentiam, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>suadere fidem veram in Christum.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Dudum <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>ego edoctus experientia didici ministerium <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>subsistere vix posse, ubi avaritia (sacril<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ega <note type="misc">gestrichen</note>) diripit publicas ecclesiasticasque opes, ac gravi<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ter ab illis per initia reformationis peccatum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>arbitror, qui reformationem inde auspicati <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>sunt, quod ecclesiasticas opes depraedandas obiecerunt <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>hypocritis docueruntque nullo iure exigi <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>aut pendi decimas et alia tributa ecclesi<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>astica.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Sed frustra nunc de his disseren[do] <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>querimur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Dominus sarciat illata ecclesiae <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>damna!</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Si opus vobis sit fideli aliquo <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ministro, submittemus unum aut alterum.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l2527">Ulmae</placeName><note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">Gemeint ist Reutti ob der Donau (Amstetten), das Besitz eines Ulmer Patriziers war; s. Werner <hi>Seeling</hi>, Johannes Willing (1525-1572). Ein Schicksal zwischen Luthertum und Calvinismus (Versuch einer Biographie), Otterbach 1972, inbes. S. 45f.</note> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>docuerunt <persName ref="p3959">Ioannes Willingus</persName>, qui antea quoque in <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><placeName ref="l648">Rhetia</placeName> docuit; eum propediem a Lutherano <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>doctore <persName ref="p20249">Ludovico Rabo</persName> eiectum iri metuo; <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>eiectus est alius quidam vir bonus d. <persName ref="p1278">Ioannes Gastius</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>qui locum aliquem, in quo agat, quaerit; rescribe er<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>go, quid spei restet.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta d. <persName ref="p8359">Philippum Gallicium</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>et d. consules et <persName ref="p6130">Pontasellam</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de">Gester ist ein franzö<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sischer tag zuͦ Baden den 11 Orten angangen, sol der <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>könig knächten begären.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Ist ein zwytracht de<lb xml:id="p1z37"/>n orten; dann ettliche wöllend die vereinigung <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>hinus gen und sich des königs abthuͦn etc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Ist <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>aber ein ars pecunias consequendi; der tüffel <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>hatt uns des wäses beradten.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Non diu subsistet deplorata haec corruptio et pudenda nequitia e<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>tc.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Vix haec potui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l587">Tiguri</placeName> 13. maii 1558.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta d. <persName ref="p20248">Valentinum Wincklerum</persName>, cuius literas accepi; <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ages illi gratias nomine meo etc.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Si quid in <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>gratiam eius potuero, <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>libens faciam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Praestantissimo d. <persName ref="p8009">Ioanni Fabritio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> ecclesiae ministro <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>fideli, domino et compatri suo colendissimo et charissimo.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="author">[Von anderer Hand:]</note>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="de">Her <persName ref="p8009">Hans Schmiden</persName> ze <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName> zuͦ Sant Martin.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
